        {"unit_id": "u-ad031f75eede79a8ab4e", "start_line": 4663, "end_line": 4671, "role": "dependency", "dependency_reason": "Shows row initialization setting the flag on the after side."},
        {"unit_id": "u-e9cdca141412a92154b2", "start_line": 139, "end_line": 179, "role": "dependency", "dependency_reason": "Shows the old entry's call order and end read."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "counterevidence",
      "statement": "The old entry's read loop does call png_read_end after the rows, so the absence of post IDAT handling from png_read_info alone does not show that the frozen behavior is unreachable. The supplied evidence does not include png_read_end's dispatch body.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id": "u-e9cdca141412a92154b2", "start_line": 169, "end_line": 179, "role": "primary", "dependency_reason": ""},
        {"unit_id": "u-ca42179a2998cf81b645", "start_line": 162, "end_line": 165, "role": "dependency", "dependency_reason": "Identifies where the initial information read stops."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "counterevidence",
      "statement": "Compressed iTXt can also call png_decompress_chunk, but it is a different chunk format and does not by itself establish handling of the frozen zTXt after IDAT tuple.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id": "u-0dfc49026104a05dcbef", "start_line": 2763, "end_line": 2774, "role": "dependency", "dependency_reason": "Shows the iTXt format and compression condition before the change."},
        {"unit_id": "u-0dfc49026104a05dcbef", "start_line": 2803, "end_line": 2813, "role": "dependency", "dependency_reason": "Shows its decompressor call before the change."},
        {"unit_id": "u-55c098640770f921b421", "start_line": 2764, "end_line": 2775, "role": "dependency", "dependency_reason": "Shows the iTXt format and compression condition after the change."},
        {"unit_id": "u-55c098640770f921b421", "start_line": 2804, "end_line": 2814, "role": "dependency", "dependency_reason": "Shows its decompressor call after the change."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "consequence",
      "statement": "The complete old harness contains checks for the PNG signature, IHDR retrieval, and an image size limit, but no assertion or metadata check requiring decompressed zTXt after png_read_end.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id": "u-e9cdca141412a92154b2", "start_line": 1, "end_line": 186, "role": "primary", "dependency_reason": ""}
      ],
      "absence_claim": true,
